{#- The About page, shared by the three languages. -#}
<section class="shell page-hero about-hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">{{ "The philosophy behind the work" | t(lang) }}</p>
  <h1>{{ "Clarity into action." | t(lang) }}</h1>
  <p class="lede">{{ "Stiven Catalyst is built around one idea: better results begin with clearer thinking, and clearer thinking matters only when it changes what happens next." | t(lang) }}</p>
</section>

<section class="shell about-intro" aria-labelledby="about-author-heading">
  <figure class="about-portrait"><img src="/media/stiven-about.jpg" alt="Stiven Janaqi" width="360" height="360"></figure>
  <div class="about-intro-copy">
    <p class="kicker">{{ "Behind the work" | t(lang) }}</p>
    <h2 id="about-author-heading">Stiven Janaqi</h2>
    <p class="about-role">{{ "Operations & leadership · Last mile · Hotels" | t(lang) }}</p>
    <p>{{ "Stiven has worked in operations for more than ten years, about eight of them leading teams: in retail and wholesale in Albania, then in last-mile logistics and hotels in Germany. In Albania he ran stores and a wholesale business and built a national network of 61 active resellers. In Germany he started again from the ground up, as a parcel courier and a night auditor, and worked his way back into leadership." | t(lang) }}</p>
    <p>{{ "As Area Manager for last-mile operations in 2025 he led four shift leads and eight dispatchers, with about 250 drivers on the road. Since November 2025 he has been Night Manager at a Radisson Group hotel in Frankfurt, and since January 2026 he has also coordinated more than 80 vehicles from home, as a part-time last-mile dispatcher." | t(lang) }}</p>
    <p>{{ "He has seen how a missed handoff, an unclear standard or a rushed shift changes the number on a dashboard. He writes from that practical perspective and builds small tools that help people see the work, ask better questions and make the next shift easier to run." | t(lang) }}</p>
    {#- Each figure under its label; the figure is shown first. #}
    <dl class="about-stats">
      <div><dt>{{ "years in operations" | t(lang) }}</dt><dd>10+</dd></div>
      <div><dt>{{ "shift leads and dispatchers led" | t(lang) }}</dt><dd>12</dd></div>
      <div><dt>{{ "drivers on the road, led indirectly" | t(lang) }}</dt><dd>~250</dd></div>
      <div><dt>{{ "vehicles coordinated remotely" | t(lang) }}</dt><dd>80+</dd></div>
    </dl>
    <p class="about-links">
      {%- for profile in site.profiles %}
      <a class="text-link" href="{{ profile }}" rel="me noopener" target="_blank">{{ "LinkedIn" if "linkedin.com" in profile else profile }} <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      {%- endfor %}
      {#- The About page is Stiven's own page: his personal address (site.personalEmail); the general one is on Contact. #}
      {%- set aboutEmail = site.personalEmail or site.email %}
      <a class="text-link" href="mailto:{{ aboutEmail }}">{{ aboutEmail }} <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="shell section about-path" aria-labelledby="about-path-heading">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <div>
      <p class="kicker">{{ "Experience" | t(lang) }}</p>
      <h2 id="about-path-heading">{{ "Ten years close to the work." | t(lang) }}</h2>
    </div>
    <p>{{ "Retail and wholesale in Albania, then last-mile logistics and hotels in Germany: the places the essays and tools come from." | t(lang) }}</p>
  </div>
  <ol class="about-timeline">
    <li>
      <span class="about-when">{{ "2026 – today" | t(lang) }}</span>
      <div><h3>{{ "Last-mile dispatcher, remote and part-time" | t(lang) }}</h3><p>{{ "Coordination of 80+ vehicles and 100+ drivers from home: routes, drivers, delays and problems during delivery." | t(lang) }}</p></div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="about-when">{{ "2025 – today" | t(lang) }}</span>
      <div><h3>{{ "Hotel night management" | t(lang) }}</h3><p>{{ "Night Manager at a Radisson Group hotel in Frankfurt since November 2025: the night shift and the front office." | t(lang) }}</p></div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="about-when">2025</span>
      <div><h3>{{ "Team Leader, then Area Manager, last-mile operations" | t(lang) }}</h3><p>{{ "Promoted after five months. Damage, incomplete deliveries, delays and loading time followed every day with the shift leads and dispatchers." | t(lang) }}</p></div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="about-when">2021 – 2024</span>
      <div><h3>{{ "Parcel delivery, last-mile dispatch and hotel night audit" | t(lang) }}</h3><p>{{ "Started again as a parcel courier, then dispatch for 70+ drivers a shift at a delivery station; night audit and front office at hotels in Frankfurt, for a time alongside parcel delivery." | t(lang) }}</p></div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="about-when">2015 – 2021</span>
      <div><h3>{{ "Retail and wholesale management in Albania" | t(lang) }}</h3><p>{{ "Store manager, department head, general sales manager and cluster manager. Teams of up to 16 people; a national network of 61 active resellers that he built, a channel linked to revenue growth of around 30–40%." | t(lang) }}</p></div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="about-when">2012 – 2015</span>
      <div><h3>{{ "Bachelor of Business Administration" | t(lang) }}</h3><p>{{ "University of Durrës, final grade 9.38 / 10, with a scholarship, alongside work in a telecom company's shops." | t(lang) }}</p></div>
    </li>
  </ol>
  <dl class="about-more">
    <div><dt>{{ "Languages" | t(lang) }}</dt><dd>{{ "Albanian (native) · English C1 · Italian C1 · German B1" | t(lang) }}</dd></div>
    <div><dt>{{ "Methods and systems" | t(lang) }}</dt><dd>{{ "Lean · 6S · Gemba walks · Pareto · 5 Whys · SAP · OPERA PMS" | t(lang) }}</dd></div>
  </dl>
</section>

