  <div class="about-copy">
    <h2>{{ "The point is clarity. The catalyst is movement." | t(lang) }}</h2>
    <p class="large-copy">{{ "Stiven Catalyst exists to turn observation into insight, insight into action and action into progress." | t(lang) }}</p>
    <p>{{ "The mark at the heart of the identity is the full stop of “Management without theatre.”, with a ring drawn round it by hand. The point is the moment a complex problem becomes clear: said, done, no performance. The ring is the pen mark a manager makes on a report, a circle round the number that matters. But clarity alone is not enough. The meaning of" | t(lang) }} <em>{{ "Catalyst" | t(lang) }}</em> {{ "is what follows: creating the conditions for an idea, a person, a team or a system to move forward." | t(lang) }}</p>
    <p>{{ "The colours are few on purpose. Black gives the work discipline and seriousness; white creates space to think. Blue is the one accent: clarity, analysis and perspective, and the colour of the point. Gold is reserved for small moments of value and emphasis." | t(lang) }}</p>

    <div class="pillars">
      <div class="pillar"><strong>{{ "Clarity" | t(lang) }}</strong><span>{{ "Understand the problem before reacting to the symptom." | t(lang) }}</span></div>
      <div class="pillar"><strong>{{ "People" | t(lang) }}</strong><span>{{ "Results are created by people working inside real systems." | t(lang) }}</span></div>
      <div class="pillar"><strong>{{ "Systems" | t(lang) }}</strong><span>{{ "Good performance should be repeatable, not dependent on heroics." | t(lang) }}</span></div>
      <div class="pillar"><strong>{{ "Change" | t(lang) }}</strong><span>{{ "An idea becomes valuable when it changes behaviour or outcomes." | t(lang) }}</span></div>
    </div>

    <p class="large-copy">{{ "See clearly. Think differently. Act deliberately." | t(lang) }}</p>
    <p>{{ "The publication explores leadership, operations, hospitality, logistics, service, accountability, process design and the everyday realities of managing people. It is also an archive of tools and systems built to make work clearer and more reliable." | t(lang) }}</p>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/book-feature.njk" %}

{#- After the author and the book, the way on: where a new reader begins, the first essay, the built work and a word
    to the author, so the page does not end with nowhere to go. -#}
{%- set firstEssay = (collections["insights" + (lang | langSuffix)] | readingOrder(essaySeries, []))[0] %}
<section class="shell issue-more about-next" aria-labelledby="about-next-title">
  <p class="kicker">{{ "Continue reading" | t(lang) }}</p>
  <h2 id="about-next-title">{{ "Where to go next" | t(lang) }}</h2>
  <div class="issue-more-list">
    <a class="issue-more-card" href="{{ '/start.html' | local(lang) }}">
      <span class="issue-more-copy">
        <span class="issue-more-label">{{ "New to Stiven Catalyst" | t(lang) }}</span>
        <span class="issue-more-title">{{ "Start here" | t(lang) }}</span>
      </span>
    </a>
    {%- if firstEssay %}
    <a class="issue-more-card" href="{{ firstEssay.url }}">
      <span class="issue-more-copy">
        <span class="issue-more-label">{{ "Start with essay 1" | t(lang) }}</span>
        <span class="issue-more-title">{{ firstEssay.data.title }}</span>
        <span class="issue-more-meta">{{ essaySeries[0].name[lang or "en"] }}</span>
      </span>
    </a>
    {%- endif %}
    <a class="issue-more-card" href="{{ '/projects.html' | local(lang) }}">
      <span class="issue-more-copy">
        <span class="issue-more-label">{{ "Built work" | t(lang) }}</span>
        <span class="issue-more-title">{{ "Projects" | t(lang) }}</span>
      </span>
    </a>
    <a class="issue-more-card" href="{{ '/contact.html' | local(lang) }}">
      <span class="issue-more-copy">
        <span class="issue-more-label">{{ "Contact" | t(lang) }}</span>
        <span class="issue-more-title">{{ "Write to me" | t(lang) }}</span>
      </span>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
